<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/17/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting sections 3, 9, 10 and 14. Saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/17/eng@> .
